      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以后还请您，用更随意一些的方式与我相处。\n……因为从今往后，我们将要并肩前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9258647ed6dcba9bfa2edb0acd5d8c3ca9192b3e440f7a23a9c275fb1d8ffec",
